      ],
      "source": "https://grcahistory.org/sites/beyond-park-boundaries/kaibab-national-forest/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kaibab sits within the Kaibab Indian Reservation, reflecting its rich indigenous heritage.",
